* controller lines held for range 3
Vgate_r1 gate_r1 0 0
Vgate_r2 gate_r2 0 0
Vgate_r3 gate_r3 0 3.3
Vmux_a0 mux_a0 0 3.3
Vmux_a1 mux_a1 0 3.3
Vgate_out gate_out 0 0
* stand-in for the source meter: a source behind a small resistance
Vldo ldo_src 0 5
Rldo ldo_src ldo_out 0.02
* the supply of the user: it delivers current and takes none back, with
* 4.7 uF at its output and 0.5 uH of leads to the terminal
.model ONE_WAY D(IS=1e-9 N=0.02 RS=0.05)
Vuser usr 0 0.8
Duser usr usr_out ONE_WAY
Cuser usr_out 0 4.7e-06
Vlead usr_out vin_a 0
Rlead vin_a vin_b 0.02
Llead vin_b vin_raw 0.5u
* mode requests: pins of the controller behind their output resistance
Vsrc pin_src 0 PWL(0 3.3 0.001 3.3 0.00100001 0)
Rpad_src pin_src gate_src 33
Vamp pin_amp 0 PWL(0 0 0.006 0 0.00600001 3.3)
Rpad_amp pin_amp gate_amp 33
.control
save supply vin_raw vin_p usr_out g_amp s_amp g_src ldo_out vlead#branch
tran 10u 0.06 0 20u
.endc
.end
